  },
  "FileSize" : 1184,
  "NativeMsgDataArrayNum" : 26,
  "NativeMsgGroupArray" : [ {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30927,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Master Arisen, word is you've come into\r\npossession of the Ring of the First King!\r\nDid you know? For hundreds of years in Acre\r\nSelund, that ring was a thing no soul could find.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さま、《初代王の指輪》を手にされたとか！\r\nご存じですか？\r\nその指輪、アッカーシェランで数百年もの間\r\n誰にも見つけられなかった代物なんですよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789887,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What power it holds, I do not wit—us\r\nunlearned sorts, that is.\r\nBut Master Kirsty, once a noble in service to\r\nformer Queen Cress...\r\nShe may well know more of it.",
        "Jp" : "どれだけの力を秘めているのかは\r\n学も無い自分らにはわかりませんけど――\r\n元貴族であり、クレス前王に仕えていた\r\nキルスティ師ならお詳しいかもしれませんね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789888,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well now, I hear tell they're livin' in a\r\nramshackle hovel out in the back\r\no' beyond these days.\r\nThe thinkin' of the high and mighty is beyond the\r\nlikes of me— ...They don't mean to return to the\r\nRoyal Palace, I imagine.",
        "Jp" : "えーっと、今では辺鄙な場所にある\"あばら屋\"で\r\n暮らしていらっしゃるのだとか\r\n偉い方の考えることは理解できませんや\r\n――王宮には戻られないのですかね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789889,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you'd know more of the Ring of the First\r\nKing, why not try asking?",
        "Jp" : "《初代王の指輪》について\r\n詳しくお知りになりたければ\r\n一度尋ねてみてはどうです？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794853,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 660,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Liberation Army Soldier",
      "Jp" : "解放軍戦士"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30928,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Ring of the First King, is it?\r\nMaster Kirsty, now serving as High Scepter Job\r\nMaster, might well know of it.\r\nWord has it she dwells in a ramshackle hovel on\r\nthe Megadosys Plateau.",
        "Jp" : "《初代王の指輪》についてですか？\r\n今はハイセプターのジョブマスターをしている\r\nキルスティ師ならご存じかもしれませんね\r\nメガドシス高地にある、\"あばら屋\"にお住まいとか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789890,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 660,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Liberation Army Soldier",
      "Jp" : "解放軍戦士"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30929,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Ring of the First King, Samara...?\r\nAh... so 'twas with that you opened the door\r\nto Firefall Mountain.\r\nThat door will not open without aught tied to\r\nSamara, the First King— Bloodline, or\r\nheirloom, or the like.",
        "Jp" : "サマラ初代王の指輪？\r\nああ、アレで火垂れ山への扉を開いたそうだね\r\nあの扉はサマラ初代王に関わる何かが無いと\r\n開くことはないから――例えば、血統や遺品なんかのね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789891,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Ring of the First King, Samara...\r\nFor long years, its very whereabouts were unknown.\r\nMy queen—Queen Cress—she sought that ring, and\r\njourneyed far and wide in search of it.",
        "Jp" : "サマラ初代王の指輪は\r\n長年その行方すらわからなかった\r\n私の王――クレス様も\r\nその指輪を探し求め、各地を巡られたものだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789892,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I accompanied Her Majesty on that search for the\r\nring, as it happens.\r\nThe Relics of the First King... their power is\r\ntoo great, they say— Too dangerous to\r\ncommend to common soldiers.",
        "Jp" : "指輪探しの旅には私も同行したよ\r\n初代王の遺品は、その強すぎる力によって\r\n扱いが難しいとされている――\r\nそこらの兵士に探させるわけにはいかなくてね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789893,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What? You wish to hear of Queen Cress?\r\nThen... let me see... Would you indulge my\r\nreminiscences awhile?",
        "Jp" : "なに？　クレス様について聞きたいのか？\r\nならば――そうだな――少し、私の思い出話に\r\n付き合う気はないかい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789894,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Dark Path to the Secret Spring... let us\r\nspeak there. 'Tis a place you've visited before,\r\nso you should not lose your way. Wait at the\r\nentrance — I shall be there anon.",
        "Jp" : "《秘泉への暗道》、そこで話をしよう\r\n君も行ったことがある場所だから\r\n迷うことは無いだろう？\r\n入口で待っていてくれ、私もすぐに向かう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794319,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30930,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let's meet at the Dark Path to the Secret Spring.\r\n— I'd ne'er have thought it, but you won't\r\nlose your way, will you?\r\nYou've been there once before, after all.\r\nI'll be along anon.",
        "Jp" : "《秘泉への暗道》で待ち合わせよう\r\n――まさかとは思うが、迷うことは無いね？\r\n君も一度は行っているはずだ\r\n私もすぐに向かうよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789895,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30931,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The place deeper in where Prince Nedo performed\r\nthe secret rite — let us go to the spring with\r\nthe dragon stone statue.\r\n... It's been a fair while since I've pressed\r\ninto a dungeon with another.",
        "Jp" : "この奥にある、ネド王子が秘蹟を行った場所\r\n竜の石像のある泉へ行こう\r\n――誰かと共にダンジョンを進むというのは\r\nかなり久しぶりだな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789896,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ere... I was with Queen Cress.",
        "Jp" : "前は、クレス様と一緒だった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794320,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30932,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Queen Cress underwent the secret rite at this\r\nspring, just as Prince Nedo did. 'Twas I who\r\nstood guard at that time.",
        "Jp" : "クレス様も、ネド王子と同じく\r\nこの泉で秘蹟を行われたんだ\r\nその時に護衛したのが私だった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789904,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When we were still girls— Queen Cress named me\r\nHigh Scepter, though we'd only met a few times at\r\nthe Royal Palace. Why, I know not.",
        "Jp" : "私たちがまだ少女だった頃――\r\n何度か王宮で顔を合わせただけの私を\r\nクレス様はなぜかハイセプターにと指名された"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789905,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I accepted the position without any particular\r\nthought— studied under the previous High\r\nScepter, honed my skills.\r\nFortunately, 'twould seem I had quite\r\nthe aptitude for it.",
        "Jp" : "私は特に何も思うことなく――\r\nただの役職としてそれを受け入れ\r\n先代のハイセプターに師事し、技を磨いた\r\n幸いかなり素養もあったみたいでね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794405,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When Queen Cress performed the secret rite before\r\nthe high ministers—her profile illuminated by the\r\nshining spring—I first knew in my heart the\r\ntrue weight of my duty.",
        "Jp" : "クレス様が重臣たちの前で\r\n秘蹟を行われた時――輝く泉に照らされた\r\n横顔を見て、初めて自分の務めの重大さを\r\n心から思い知ったものだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794406,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This one is a magnificent Arisen who shall become\r\na Dragon—and that they chose me, that they are\r\nthe queen I serve... 'twas a feeling that\r\nshook me to my core.",
        "Jp" : "この方は素晴らしい竜となる覚者で――\r\nそして私を選ばれ、私がお仕えする王なのだと\r\n心の芯が震えるような思いだった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794860,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well then, this reminiscing ends here.\r\nSuch stories know no cease, you see — we must cut\r\nit short, else 'twill be quite the trouble.\r\nCome, let us return to my hearth.",
        "Jp" : "さて、今回の思い出話はここまでだ\r\n思い出話なんてのは尽きないものだからね\r\n適当に切り上げないと大変なことになる\r\nさ、私の家に戻ろうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794861,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30933,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What is it? You'd have me spin naught but\r\nreminiscences like some doddering elder?\r\nI'm afraid I've not the leisure.\r\nCome, let's return to my hovel.",
        "Jp" : "何だい？　私に、老人のように\r\n思い出話ばかりしろって？\r\n残念ながら、そこまで暇じゃないのさ\r\nさ、我があばら屋へ戻ろうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789897,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30934,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Queen Cress, who performed the sacrament at the\r\nspring, devoted herself to Acre Selund's\r\nprosperity as its queen... Let us save the rest\r\nfor another occasion. If you've leisure enow\r\nfor reminiscence... visit again.",
        "Jp" : "泉で秘蹟を行ったクレス様は王として\r\nアッカーシェランの繁栄に尽力された\r\n――この話の続きは次の機会にでもとっておこうか\r\n思い出話を聞きたいほど暇なら、またおいで"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789898,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
